# Both spellings on purpose. `node_modules/` matches a DIRECTORY only, so a
# SYMLINK named node_modules — which is what linking a git worktree's deps to
# the main checkout produces — slipped past it and got committed by `git add
# -A`, and CI then failed with ENOTDIR before it could install anything.
node_modules/
node_modules
dist/
coverage/
*.tgz
*.log
